# 143-hole-tangent-three-lines: added by the parity loop from a Fusion probe
# hole-tangent-three-lines: Fixed 60x40 plate outline; fixed construction lines x=10, x=30, y=10. A hole circle drawn at (22,24) R8 is made tangent to all three, so it becomes R10 at (20,20): area 2400-100pi, extruded 10.
